IMPORT prelude

-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1081. Two deadlines, and an act that starts a third.
-- `a` at 2 puts b's deadline (2 + 5) on top of Q's (7), and a breach on that
-- day names both parties. The explorer has to try `a` at 2 to show it.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P, Q
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a, b, c

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
clocks MEANS
  (PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 3
     HENCE (PARTY P MUST b WITHIN 5 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P)
     LEST BREACH BY P)
  RAND
  (PARTY Q MUST c WITHIN 7 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY Q)

#TRACE clocks AT 0 WITH
  PARTY P DOES a AT 2
